Package: Friedman
Title: Tools for Sports Reference Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Orlando", "Cardona", , "ocardona@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
The package provides multiple tools to help with the process of cleaning and analyzing data from the famous source of Sports Reference, a source of data for most major sports.
